1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,775
Nirbhaya.

2
00:00:01,725 --> 00:00:03,281
Disha.

3
00:00:03,281 --> 00:00:06,366
A young doctor in Kolkata.

4
00:00:06,366 --> 00:00:09,145
A schoolgirl in Raptadu.

5
00:00:09,145 --> 00:00:14,132
Every time, we all thought the same thing: never again.

6
00:00:14,132 --> 00:00:17,244
But anger alone is not enough.

7
00:00:17,244 --> 00:00:20,621
We need to bring our ideas together.

8
00:00:20,621 --> 00:00:22,523
Better lights?

9
00:00:22,523 --> 00:00:24,544
Safer travel?

10
00:00:24,544 --> 00:00:28,055
Respect, taught at home and in class?

11
00:00:28,055 --> 00:00:31,499
Acting on the very first warning sign?

12
00:00:31,499 --> 00:00:34,105
You know your place best.

13
00:00:34,105 --> 00:00:37,855
Safety is not only the government's duty.

14
00:00:37,855 --> 00:00:39,956
It is ours too.

15
00:00:39,956 --> 00:00:44,863
Open Mana Hakku, and type your idea on the Home page.

16
00:00:44,863 --> 00:00:47,323
That is all it asks.

17
00:00:47,323 --> 00:00:50,901
We hope every one of you will take part.

